s, limited palette, dark 1-2px outline, like a 16-bit console game), 8 animation frames read left to right, top to bottom: the LEGENDARY utility skill of Hỏa Linh, a fire creature. Flat solid magenta background #FF00FF everywhere. CUTOUT RULE: every frame is ONE isolated effect shape floating on magenta, with magenta clearly visible all around it (about 6% gap to each cell border); NEVER fill a cell with a rectangle of fire, smoke, water, sky or ground; no background scenery, no creature body, no text, no numbers, no grid lines, no borders. Make each effect as BIG as possible inside that gap: a huge, heavy, screen-shaking legendary move. Frames: Row 1 (frames 1-4, seamless loop): a hollow circle of five comet-like teardrop fireballs with curved tails chasing each other around, thin flame wisps between them; they rotate each frame. Row 2 (frames 5-8, seamless loop): a single teardrop fireball flying right, round white-hot head on the right with wavy flame tongues streaming left, a few sparks behind; tail wiggles frame to frame. LEGENDARY look: divine and spectacular like an anime boss final super move: thick jagged golden-white lightning bolts forking around the effect in every frame (a different bolt shape each frame so it flickers), roaring red-orange fire with white-gold cores trailing in the direction of motion, a celestial phoenix-fire motif, white-gold sun flames, shockwave rings and light rays on the big moments. Colours red, orange, yellow plus radiant gold."}, {"id": "KI-N1_tinh-kim-hiep__4", "prompt": "Create an image. IMPORTANT LAYOUT: exactly 4 columns x 3 rows of equal cells, landscape 4:3 canvas. PIXEL ART game VFX sprite sheet (crisp visible pixels, limited palette, dark 1-2px outline, like a 16-bit console game), 12 animation frames read left to right, top to bottom: the LEGENDARY ultimate skill of Tinh Kim Hiệp, a metal creature. Flat solid magenta background #FF00FF everywhere. CUTOUT RULE: every frame is ONE isolated effect shape floating on magent